KernelPatch binaries
====================

Source: https://github.com/bmax121/KernelPatch
Version: 0.13.9
License: GPL-2.0

Files:
- kptools-linux   (host tool, patches the built kernel Image)
- kpimg-android   (payload injected into the kernel Image)

Used by configs/release/compression-c2k.json to produce the KPM-capable image.
Default superkey for the C2K build is "MoonWake-C2K" and is written into the
image; it can be reset later with:

  kptools-linux -r -i <boot-or-Image> -o <output>

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for details.
